From 28e2eb29d96129a5011465a561951142d2920fe1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: svc-fpga-sol <svc-fpga-sol@microchip.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 17:10:04 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] media: platform: mchp-dscmi: add MJPEG support with
 quirks validation

Add MJPEG encoder support by introducing the
'microchip,fpga-dscmi-mjpeg-rtl-v2608' compatible with a MJPEG quirk
flag that validates the hardware MJPEG capability against the device
tree before accepting it. Implement MJPEG quantization table
programming for user-configurable quality factor (1-100).

Also fix several driver issues: division-by-zero in compression ratio
calculation, incorrect buffer state in stop_streaming, NULL pointer
guard in remove path, and various typo corrections.

Signed-off-by: svc-fpga-sol <svc-fpga-sol@microchip.com>
